Z||000000||8Ball||11-11-2001||12:10 PM||||In the past I have made keychains and notebooks out of computer parts. Even wall clocks ect ect. Well I have a chance to get my hands on quite a few dimms (RAM Strips)<BR>These make for rather neat keychains. Would anyone here be interested in any? They will cost me about 9 dollars a piece to make so I would sell them for 10 if anyone is interested.<P>Let me know.<BR>Thanks,<BR>Randy W.||||reg||1
